<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How God loves us! And in kind</l><l>We love our Lord—heart, soul, and mind!</l><l>Once on dross our love we poured;</l><l>Now, with the first love, love the Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We the Lord’s commandment take;</l><l>Love for His people ne’er forsake!</l><l>Thus the church will builded be,</l><l>Christ’s longed-for bride, eternally!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Though the earth is dark today,</l><l>Choose love, the most excelling way!</l><l>When God fills us, we embrace</l><l>Both good and bad, the human race!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
